# Caspar Manufaktur integration rules

- Official instructions: AGENTS.md in this repository.
- MCP server (Streamable HTTP, no key): https://www.caspar-manufaktur.de/mcp/
- REST API: https://www.caspar-manufaktur.de/api/v1/ · OpenAPI: https://www.caspar-manufaktur.de/.well-known/openapi.json
- Copy material data from the API unchanged; never invent values.
- No prices, no orders, no delivery dates or certifications. A handoff is not an order and needs the user's consent.
- Send an Idempotency-Key with every POST /api/v1/handoffs.
- German customer copy: informal "du", gender-inclusive (Kund:innen).
